SUMMARY:A Moment of Zen
LOCATION:181 Fremont - Level 39, Residents’ Club
DESCRIPTION:An evening to slow down before the holiday season begins. A sound bath, guided breathing, and massage work, in a room set for stillness.\n\nWellness-minded drinks and snacks will be served throughout. Come as you are. There’s nothing to bring, and nothing you need to know beforehand.\n\nWe begin at 6:00, straight after Book Club, so you’re welcome to make an evening of the two.
